{"seq":3,"slug":"team-memory","title":"团队记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/claude-code-architecture/memory-system/team-memory","wordCount":1381,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"团队记忆\">团队记忆</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>teamMemPaths.ts</code>（292 行）用<strong>双目录</strong>实现团队共享：私有记忆在 <code>memory/</code>，共享记忆在 <code>memory/team/</code>。每个开发者既有私人空间，又能与团队共享项目约定。</p>\n<p>但一旦涉及跨用户写路径，「路径就是攻击面」——因此写入前有多重防护：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防护机制</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>PathTraversalError</code></td>\n<td>拦截 <code>../</code> 等路径穿越</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>realpathDeepestExisting</code></td>\n<td>解析符号链接，防链接逃逸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>validateTeamMemWritePath</code></td>\n<td>两阶段校验写入目标合法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>validateTeamMemKey</code></td>\n<td>校验键名格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const { privateDir, teamDir } = resolveTeamMemoryPaths(projectDir);&#10;// privateDir = memory/  ·  teamDir = memory/team/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">privateDir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">teamDir</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveTeamMemoryPaths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectDir);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// privateDir = memory/  ·  teamDir = memory/team/</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>要点：</strong> 共享目录让「谁能读到这条记忆」发生变化，所以安全校验不是可选项——写入前必须确认目标确实落在 team 目录内。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"双目录架构\">双目录架构</h2><p><code>teamMemPaths.ts</code>（292 行）实现了团队记忆的核心架构：私有记忆目录 <code>memory/</code> 和共享记忆目录 <code>memory/team/</code> 并存。这种双目录设计让每个开发者既有私人记忆空间，又能与团队共享项目约定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TeamMemoryPaths {&#10;  privateDir: string;&#10;  teamDir: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function resolveTeamMemoryPaths(projectDir: string): TeamMemoryPaths {&#10;  return {&#10;    privateDir: path.join(projectDir, &#39;memory&#39;),&#10;    teamDir: path.join(projectDir, &#39;memory&#39;, &#39;team&#39;),&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeamMemoryPaths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  privateDir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  teamDir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveTeamMemoryPaths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">projectDir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeamMemoryPaths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    privateDir: path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectDir, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'memory'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    teamDir: path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectDir, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'memory'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'team'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ROOT[&quot;~/.claude/projects/&amp;lt;hash&amp;gt;/&quot;] --&gt; MEM[&quot;memory/&quot;]&#10;    MEM --&gt; PRIV[&quot;私有记忆文件&quot;]&#10;    MEM --&gt; TEAM[&quot;team/&quot;]&#10;    TEAM --&gt; SHARED[&quot;共享记忆文件&quot;]&#10;&#10;    PRIV --&gt; P1[&quot;preferences.md&lt;br/&gt;(个人偏好)&quot;]&#10;    PRIV --&gt; P2[&quot;corrections.md&lt;br/&gt;(个人修正)&quot;]&#10;    SHARED --&gt; S1[&quot;conventions.md&lt;br/&gt;(团队约定)&quot;]&#10;    SHARED --&gt; S2[&quot;architecture.md&lt;br/&gt;(架构规范)&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    ROOT[\"~/.claude/projects/&amp;lt;hash&amp;gt;/\"] --&gt; MEM[\"memory/\"]\n    MEM --&gt; PRIV[\"私有记忆文件\"]\n    MEM --&gt; TEAM[\"team/\"]\n    TEAM --&gt; SHARED[\"共享记忆文件\"]\n\n    PRIV --&gt; P1[\"preferences.md&lt;br/&gt;(个人偏好)\"]\n    PRIV --&gt; P2[\"corrections.md&lt;br/&gt;(个人修正)\"]\n    SHARED --&gt; S1[\"conventions.md&lt;br/&gt;(团队约定)\"]\n    SHARED --&gt; S2[\"architecture.md&lt;br/&gt;(架构规范)\"]\n</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目录</th>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>可见范围</th>\n<th>写入权限</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>私有目录</td>\n<td><code>memory/</code></td>\n<td>仅当前用户</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>个人偏好、修正记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队目录</td>\n<td><code>memory/team/</code></td>\n<td>所有团队成员</td>\n<td>安全验证</td>\n<td>编码约定、架构规范</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种隔离确保了个人偏好（如编辑器主题、快捷键习惯）不会污染团队共享空间，同时团队约定（如代码风格、分支策略）对所有成员可见。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 团队目录通常通过 Git 管理并随项目代码一起版本控制，而私有目录保持在 <code>.gitignore</code> 中，不进入版本库。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pathtraversalerror-安全防护\">PathTraversalError 安全防护</h2><p>团队记忆目录面临的首要安全威胁是路径遍历攻击——恶意构造的路径可能试图跳出 <code>memory/team/</code> 目录访问系统文件。系统定义了专门的错误类型来处理此类攻击。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class PathTraversalError extends Error {&#10;  constructor(&#10;    public readonly attemptedPath: string,&#10;    public readonly resolvedPath: string,&#10;    public readonly allowedDir: string,&#10;  ) {&#10;    super(&#10;      `Path traversal detected: ${attemptedPath} resolved to ${resolvedPath}, ` +&#10;        `which is outside allowed directory ${allowedDir}`,&#10;    );&#10;    this.name = &#39;PathTraversalError&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathTraversalError</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> attemptedPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> resolvedPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> allowedDir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      `Path traversal detected: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">attemptedPath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} resolved to ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resolvedPath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, `</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        `which is outside allowed directory ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">allowedDir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PathTraversalError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>攻击向量和对应的防御措施：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>攻击向量</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>防御机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>..</code> 相对路径</td>\n<td><code>../../etc/passwd</code></td>\n<td>字符串包含检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号链接</td>\n<td><code>link → /etc/</code></td>\n<td>realpath 解析验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对路径注入</td>\n<td><code>/etc/shadow</code></td>\n<td>路径前缀校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>null 字节截断</td>\n<td><code>file\\x00.md</code></td>\n<td>null 字节检测拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套 <code>..</code></td>\n<td><code>a/../../b</code></td>\n<td>两阶段验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INPUT[用户提供的路径] --&gt; NULL{含 null 字节?}&#10;    NULL --&gt;|是| REJECT1[拒绝: null 字节]&#10;    NULL --&gt;|否| ABS{绝对路径?}&#10;    ABS --&gt;|是| REJECT2[拒绝: 绝对路径]&#10;    ABS --&gt;|否| DOT{含 .. ?}&#10;    DOT --&gt;|是| REJECT3[拒绝: 路径遍历]&#10;    DOT --&gt;|否| VALIDATE[进入两阶段验证]\">flowchart TD\n    INPUT[用户提供的路径] --&gt; NULL{含 null 字节?}\n    NULL --&gt;|是| REJECT1[拒绝: null 字节]\n    NULL --&gt;|否| ABS{绝对路径?}\n    ABS --&gt;|是| REJECT2[拒绝: 绝对路径]\n    ABS --&gt;|否| DOT{含 .. ?}\n    DOT --&gt;|是| REJECT3[拒绝: 路径遍历]\n    DOT --&gt;|否| VALIDATE[进入两阶段验证]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"realpathdeepestexisting-符号链接解析\">realpathDeepestExisting 符号链接解析</h2><p>路径验证中最复杂的部分是处理符号链接。<code>realpathDeepestExisting()</code> 采用逐级解析策略：从路径的最深层开始，逐级向上查找实际存在的目录，对每一级都执行 <code>realpath()</code> 解析符号链接。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function realpathDeepestExisting(targetPath: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  let current = targetPath;&#10;  const remaining: string[] = [];&#10;&#10;  while (current !== path.dirname(current)) {&#10;    try {&#10;      const resolved = await fs.realpath(current);&#10;      const tail = remaining.reverse().join(path.sep);&#10;      return tail ? path.join(resolved, tail) : resolved;&#10;    } catch {&#10;      remaining.push(path.basename(current));&#10;      current = path.dirname(current);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return path.join(current, ...remaining.reverse());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> realpathDeepestExisting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">targetPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> targetPath;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> remaining</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dirname</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">realpath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path.sep);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolved, tail) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resolved;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      remaining.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">basename</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dirname</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">remaining.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant F as realpathDeepestExisting&#10;    participant FS as 文件系统&#10;&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;FS: realpath(&quot;/a/b/c/d&quot;)&#10;    FS--&gt;&gt;F: ENOENT (不存在)&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;FS: realpath(&quot;/a/b/c&quot;)&#10;    FS--&gt;&gt;F: ENOENT&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;FS: realpath(&quot;/a/b&quot;)&#10;    FS--&gt;&gt;F: &quot;/real/path/b&quot; (存在,含符号链接解析)&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;F: 拼接剩余部分&#10;    Note over F: 返回 &quot;/real/path/b/c/d&quot;\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant F as realpathDeepestExisting\n    participant FS as 文件系统\n\n    F-&gt;&gt;FS: realpath(\"/a/b/c/d\")\n    FS--&gt;&gt;F: ENOENT (不存在)\n    F-&gt;&gt;FS: realpath(\"/a/b/c\")\n    FS--&gt;&gt;F: ENOENT\n    F-&gt;&gt;FS: realpath(\"/a/b\")\n    FS--&gt;&gt;F: \"/real/path/b\" (存在,含符号链接解析)\n    F-&gt;&gt;F: 拼接剩余部分\n    Note over F: 返回 \"/real/path/b/c/d\"</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>尝试全路径</td>\n<td><code>realpath(full)</code></td>\n<td>快速路径：完整路径存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐级回退</td>\n<td><code>dirname() + 重试</code></td>\n<td>找到最深的已存在祖先目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拼接剩余</td>\n<td><code>join(resolved, tail)</code></td>\n<td>用真实路径替换符号链接部分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种逐级解析避免了一个常见的安全漏洞：攻击者可能创建一个中间目录的符号链接指向敏感位置，而简单的字符串检查无法发现此类间接引用。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>realpathDeepestExisting()</code> 是一个&quot;尽力而为&quot;的函数——即使目标路径不完全存在，也能解析已存在部分的真实路径，确保安全验证不会因文件不存在而被绕过。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"validateteammemwritepath-两阶段验证\">validateTeamMemWritePath 两阶段验证</h2><p>写入团队记忆是最高安全级别的操作，<code>validateTeamMemWritePath()</code> 实现了两阶段验证流程：先进行字符串级别的包含检查，再进行完整的符号链接解析验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function validateTeamMemWritePath(requestedPath: string, teamDir: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const normalized = path.normalize(path.join(teamDir, requestedPath));&#10;&#10;  if (!normalized.startsWith(teamDir + path.sep) &amp;&amp; normalized !== teamDir) {&#10;    throw new PathTraversalError(requestedPath, normalized, teamDir);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const resolved = await realpathDeepestExisting(normalized);&#10;&#10;  if (!resolved.startsWith(teamDir + path.sep) &amp;&amp; resolved !== teamDir) {&#10;    throw new PathTraversalError(requestedPath, resolved, teamDir);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return resolved;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateTeamMemWritePath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">requestedPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">teamDir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> normalized</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teamDir, requestedPath));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">normalized.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teamDir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.sep) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teamDir) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathTraversalError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(requestedPath, normalized, teamDir);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> realpathDeepestExisting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(normalized);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resolved.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teamDir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.sep) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resolved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teamDir) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathTraversalError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(requestedPath, resolved, teamDir);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resolved;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    REQ[请求路径] --&gt; NORM[&quot;path.normalize()&quot;]&#10;    NORM --&gt; PASS1{&quot;第一阶段&lt;br/&gt;字符串包含?&quot;}&#10;    PASS1 --&gt;|不在 teamDir 内| ERR1[PathTraversalError]&#10;    PASS1 --&gt;|在 teamDir 内| REAL[&quot;realpathDeepestExisting()&quot;]&#10;    REAL --&gt; PASS2{&quot;第二阶段&lt;br/&gt;解析后仍在 teamDir 内?&quot;}&#10;    PASS2 --&gt;|否| ERR2[PathTraversalError]&#10;    PASS2 --&gt;|是| OK[返回安全路径]&#10;\">flowchart TD\n    REQ[请求路径] --&gt; NORM[\"path.normalize()\"]\n    NORM --&gt; PASS1{\"第一阶段&lt;br/&gt;字符串包含?\"}\n    PASS1 --&gt;|不在 teamDir 内| ERR1[PathTraversalError]\n    PASS1 --&gt;|在 teamDir 内| REAL[\"realpathDeepestExisting()\"]\n    REAL --&gt; PASS2{\"第二阶段&lt;br/&gt;解析后仍在 teamDir 内?\"}\n    PASS2 --&gt;|否| ERR2[PathTraversalError]\n    PASS2 --&gt;|是| OK[返回安全路径]\n</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证阶段</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>防御目标</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一阶段</td>\n<td>字符串 startsWith</td>\n<td><code>..</code> 和绝对路径注入</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二阶段</td>\n<td>realpath 解析</td>\n<td>符号链接重定向</td>\n<td>中（I/O）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两阶段设计的原理：第一阶段是廉价的快速拒绝（fast-reject），可以在不触发任何 I/O 的情况下拦截大部分恶意路径；只有通过第一阶段的路径才需要执行开销更大的 realpath 解析。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"validateteammemkey-键名验证\">validateTeamMemKey 键名验证</h2><p>除了路径验证，记忆文件的键名（文件名）本身也需要安全检查。<code>validateTeamMemKey()</code> 拒绝三类危险输入。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function validateTeamMemKey(key: string): void {&#10;  if (key.includes(&#39;..&#39;)) {&#10;    throw new PathTraversalError(key, key, &#39;team memory key&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (path.isAbsolute(key)) {&#10;    throw new PathTraversalError(key, key, &#39;team memory key&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (key.includes(&#39;\\0&#39;)) {&#10;    throw new PathTraversalError(key, key, &#39;team memory key (null byte)&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateTeamMemKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (key.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'..'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathTraversalError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, key, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'team memory key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAbsolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathTraversalError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, key, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'team memory key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (key.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PathTraversalError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, key, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'team memory key (null byte)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>拒绝模式</th>\n<th>安全原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>..</code> 子串</td>\n<td><code>../../etc</code></td>\n<td>目录遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对路径</td>\n<td><code>/etc/passwd</code></td>\n<td>跳出相对路径范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>null 字节</td>\n<td><code>file\\x00.md</code></td>\n<td>C 语言层面的字符串截断攻击</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    KEY[记忆键名] --&gt; C1{含 .. ?}&#10;    C1 --&gt;|是| X1[拒绝]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|否| C2{绝对路径?}&#10;    C2 --&gt;|是| X2[拒绝]&#10;    C2 --&gt;|否| C3{含 null?}&#10;    C3 --&gt;|是| X3[拒绝]&#10;    C3 --&gt;|否| OK[通过]\">flowchart LR\n    KEY[记忆键名] --&gt; C1{含 .. ?}\n    C1 --&gt;|是| X1[拒绝]\n    C1 --&gt;|否| C2{绝对路径?}\n    C2 --&gt;|是| X2[拒绝]\n    C2 --&gt;|否| C3{含 null?}\n    C3 --&gt;|是| X3[拒绝]\n    C3 --&gt;|否| OK[通过]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> null 字节攻击在 Node.js 中已经被 <code>fs</code> 模块自身防御，但 <code>validateTeamMemKey()</code> 仍然显式检查，体现了&quot;纵深防御&quot;（defense-in-depth）的安全理念。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"teammemprompts-与-scope-标签\">teamMemPrompts 与 scope 标签</h2><p><code>teamMemPrompts.ts</code> 定义了团队记忆的 prompt 模板，使用 <code>&lt;scope&gt;</code> 标签明确区分私有记忆和团队记忆的来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const TYPES_SECTION_COMBINED = `&#10;&lt;memory-types&gt;&#10;  &lt;scope type=&quot;private&quot;&gt;&#10;    These are your personal memories. Only you can see them.&#10;    Store personal preferences and individual corrections here.&#10;  &lt;/scope&gt;&#10;  &lt;scope type=&quot;team&quot;&gt;&#10;    These are shared team memories. All team members can see them.&#10;    Store coding conventions, architecture decisions, and shared context here.&#10;  &lt;/scope&gt;&#10;&lt;/memory-types&gt;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TYPES_SECTION_COMBINED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;memory-types></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;scope type=\"private\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    These are your personal memories. Only you can see them.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Store personal preferences and individual corrections here.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;/scope></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;scope type=\"team\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    These are shared team memories. All team members can see them.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Store coding conventions, architecture decisions, and shared context here.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;/scope></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/memory-types></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>buildCombinedMemoryPrompt()</code> 将两个目录的内容合并为统一的 prompt：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function buildCombinedMemoryPrompt(projectDir: string): string {&#10;  const paths = resolveTeamMemoryPaths(projectDir);&#10;  const sections: string[] = [];&#10;&#10;  sections.push(TYPES_SECTION_COMBINED);&#10;&#10;  const privateMemories = scanMemoryDirectory(paths.privateDir);&#10;  if (privateMemories.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    sections.push(&#39;&lt;private-memories&gt;\\n&#39; + formatMemoryList(privateMemories) + &#39;\\n&lt;/private-memories&gt;&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const teamMemories = scanMemoryDirectory(paths.teamDir);&#10;  if (teamMemories.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    sections.push(&#39;&lt;team-memories&gt;\\n&#39; + formatMemoryList(teamMemories) + &#39;\\n&lt;/team-memories&gt;&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return sections.join(&#39;\\n\\n&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildCombinedMemoryPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">projectDir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--